+# JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)
+
+Request: export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386.
+
+Done: implemented in `src/index.ts` (non-object patch replaces; `null` deletes; recursive merge; arrays
+replaced whole; inputs not mutated; `__proto__` safe). Tests in `test/mergepatch.test.ts` cover the RFC
+appendix A cases. README documents it.
